00000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Action Plan:-</span></h2>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Exam rules will be added to exam screen. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">[Backlog] New checklist on platform testing to establish and members from all team to test each process before go live on major updates to prevent bugs</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Each team to submit budget on Friday. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Sub Team Reports:-</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Platform Team Report by Sam Suresh</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Chris viewed QMS and to come back with feedback for exam team.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Status for questions in the QMS to be developed this week. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">No progress yet on com_session but Michael have started to work on.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Marketing Team Report by Richard Van Tilborg</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Updated website</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Working on JAB and JWC Session</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Operations Team Report by Luca Marzo</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.6363636363636362; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Todd prepared a set of questions that can be helpful to prepare the Supervisor orientation, as requested by the Steering group last week.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.6363636363636362; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">JoomlaDay UK application approved. The organizer to sign the Agreement and we can start all the other processes for that.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 19pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">No report from Exam Team</span></p>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>', NULL, 1, 220, 1, 813, '2017-05-23 12:41:37', 0, '2017-05-23 12:42:24', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(534, 52, 0, 'Bi-weekly report from Legal and Finance', 'bi-weekly-report-from-legal-and-finance', '<p style="word-wrap: break-word;"><strong>Capital Team</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>No meeting held</li>\r\n<li>Discussed draft "mandate"&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Implementing banners from Rochen throughout site</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style="word-wrap: break-word;"><strong>Conflict Resolution Team</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Looking for non-partisan volunteers from outside the organisation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style="word-wrap: break-word;"><strong>Legal Working Group</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Looking for more volunteers.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style="word-wrap: break-word;"><strong>Trademark and Licensing [edited]</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>No report</li>\r\n<li>Looking for volunteers</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 221, 1, 488, '2017-05-25 10:55:48', 0, '2017-05-25 10:57:49', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(535, 55, 0, 'Joomla Operations Department Meeting, May 24, 2017', 'joomla-operations-department-meeting-may-24-2017', '<h2 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Joomla Operations Department Meeting</h2>\r\n<p>Wednesday May 24 2017, 19:00:00 &nbsp;UTC</p>\r\n<p><strong>Participants</strong>: Jaz Parkyn (Extensions Directory Team), Olaf Offick (Forum&nbsp;Team), Peter Martin (Operations Department Coordinator), Brian Mitchell&nbsp;(Resource Directory Team), Sebastien Lapoux (Showcase Directory Team),&nbsp;Sander Potjer (Volunteers Portal Team).</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apologies</strong>: Helvecio da Silva (Community Magazine Team), Isidro Baquero&nbsp;(Template Directory Team), Claire Mandville (Vulnerable Extensions List&nbsp;Team).</p>\r\n<h2>Minutes:</h2>\r\n<h3>Operations Department Coordinator</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href="board-of-directors/reports/521-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-may-11-2017https://volunteers.joomla.org/board-of-directors/reports/521-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-may-11-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Board of Directors Full Board Meeting - May 11, 2017</a></li>\r\n<li><a href="board-of-directors/reports/521-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-may-11-2017https://volunteers.joomla.org/board-of-directors/reports/521-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-may-11-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a><a href="board-of-directors/reports/507-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-april-27-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Board of Directors Full Board Meeting - April 27, 2017</a></li>\r\n<li>The Joomla Volunteer Portal (JVP) lists all people of Teams that are helping in the project. To have an accurate overview, all team pages need to be up-to-date. Teams consist of Members (with active members who have voting rights) and Contributors (who contribute once and awhile, and do not have voting rights). A requirement of the OSM By-Laws is that all postal addresses of Team members (with voting rights) are available. The postal addresses are not publicly visible; only the OSM secretary has access to them. Peter asked all teams to get their Team listing up-to-date and have all Members update their listing with their postal address.</li>\r\n<li>Peter has submitted a request for budget for all the teams till June 2018.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Extensions Directory Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href="teams/extensions-directory-team/reports/509-jed-team-meeting-april-28-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JED Team Meeting - April 28, 2017</a></li>\r\n<li>JED is currently looking for a better search index solution (like Algolia and ElasticSearch) to make it easier and faster to search the public JED listings, and to have a better private search solution for internal JED communication like tickets etc.</li>\r\n<li>JED team decided that their team Members (with voting rights) need to attend the JED meetings in order to be Member. Otherwise they will be listed as Contributor</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Forum Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href="teams/forum-team/reports/532-2017-04" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Forum statistics</a></li>\r\n<li>The Members listed on the team page are the Global Moderators and is up-to-date.</li>\r\n<li>There is currently no option to check if all Members have updated their postal address</li>\r\n<li>Toivo Talikka is the new Assistant Team Leader (Peter will change that in JVP).</li>\r\n<li>Forum Team will review all moderators (general and local moderators). Most moderators are not yet listed at JVP. They will be requested to add themselves, to keep an up-to-date list of Moderators and also give them recognition for their work.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Resource Directory Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Team page is not up to date, they are working on it.</li>\r\n<li>Deb Cinkus is the new Assistant Team Leader (Peter will change that in JVP)</li>\r\n<li>The current JRD website is v2. The JRD Team is looking to implement some new features and to get rid of some hardcoded legacy code. They are planning for a v3 of the site. Soren Jensen offered to build a custom component if the Team can supply him with the requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Showcase Directory Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Showcase Directory lists currently 377 Joomla websites. The Showcase Team will work with the Social Media team to get more quality Joomla websites being submitted.</li>\r\n<li>The Joomla.org homepage will get a &ldquo;Who is using Joomla?&rdquo; block with 4 references that are taken out of the Showcase Directory. At first manually and in the future at random.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Volunteers Portal Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Volunteers Portal was working with implementing a Recruitment role in its JVP. However there&rsquo;s also a new initiative of a Recruitment Team under the Program Department. We need to coordinate these initiatives so we are not doing double work.</li>\r\n<li>The postal addresses of all Team members in the Volunteer Portal, a requirement of the OSM By-Laws, are only accessible by the OSM Secretary. However, Site Admins and Developers with access to the database might be able to access the information too. What can we do to safeguard the information properly?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Vulnerable Extensions List Team</h3>\r\n<p>Claire not present but added the following information. Carried over to&nbsp;next meeting.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>No meeting since last meeting , one due in june.</li>\r\n<li>From may 1st VEL analytics:<br />Page Views 4,393 Unique Page Views 2,928<br />Page /live-vel Page Views 1,393<br />"how to exploit joomla extensions" being the top search phrase.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Shortly implementing new dedicated vel ticket/referencing system.</li>\r\n<li>The meeting notes (jan17) provided by VEL are as much as can be stated without naming and shaming or passing sensitive info. Much the same as JSST.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Community Magazine Team</h3>\r\n<p>Helvecio not present. Carried over to next meeting.</p>\r\n<h3>Template Directory Team</h3>\r\n<p>Isidro not present. Carried over to next meeting.</p>', NULL, 1, 222, 1, 443, '2017-05-25 18:47:06', 0, '2017-05-25 18:56:20', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(536, 0, 107, '2nd Meeting GSoC 17 - Expand Extensions Manager', '2nd-meeting-gsoc-17-expand-extensions-manager', '<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Date: 22/05/2017</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time: 20:00 PM UTC</span></p>\r\n<p><b id="docs-internal-guid-42f03765-44a9-325b-2ae1-90b4364327be" style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting was attended by: </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Anibal Sanchez, Roland Dalmulder, Yves Hoppe, Nuno Lopes</span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3090909090909089; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"><span style="font-size: 16.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Topics:</span></h2>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3333333333333333; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1- Discussing the feature Show Changelog</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">After last meeting I started the Show Changelog feature and implemented everything that we discussed and asked for a evaluation on it to mentors.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We decided here that the feature will be on an iframe with a button with &ldquo;Changelog&rdquo; next to the new version on Extensions-&gt;Update:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/9yPC_xNWSnWqsAy1tf8J5TVwn7CxRPxEpX7zxI1ezI8zqx2yYQSXN53WLoGgRKhDE3TKgErsP6WGrPE6o4TuOuW6VOBfQxnQtXmdsm-H6GcCXUywEYXZq15JddPXm4bpJ48V3I_6" alt="" width="602" height="85" style="border: none; transform: rotate(0.00rad); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad);" /></span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">And when clicking on Changelog it will show a modal with an iframe:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/Bz8RQsZKa-a6otO1DL66FImBhJp4wYB406J6shYkWRSX740tV3Hpd0plGjOMJUes0tDlyqauhOCmuN0fOlbVt5K5hpTqd-udHIh8k7yrYW7n-KQfPbMwYCkISDyuFNiBdwXZD1tw" alt="" width="602" height="301" style="border: none; transform: rotate(0.00rad); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad);" /></span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This feature is almost done.</span></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3333333333333333; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2- Discussing the edit update site feature</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Last meeting we didn&rsquo;t had time to discuss this feature and so we needed to discuss it in this meeting.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Roland helped to understand why this feature was needed and the best ways to do it. When an update site change it&rsquo;s own url on server it just doesn&rsquo;t replace the old one, it just adds a new one. With this feature, the old url&rsquo;s will be deleted and only the new ones will stay.</span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3. To Do - Next Steps</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Next meeting it\'s time to talk about the last features and if we have time discuss the Database Fix feature.</span></p>', NULL, 1, 223, 1, 2495, '2017-05-26 11:54:24', 0, '2017-05-26 12:09:43', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(537, 0, 108, '3rd Meeting: GSoC 17 JS tests for Joomla 4!', '3rd-meeting-gsoc-17-js-tests-for-joomla-4', '<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Friday</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, 26th May 2017 on Glip</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time: 10.00p.m (Colombo Sri Lanka), 6:30 p.m (Munich Germany)</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Report: Supun</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Previous meeting report</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">List of Attendees Overview</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 0pt;">\r\n<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="204"><col width="48"><col width="45"><col width="253"><col width="42"><col width="29"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #1c4587; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #ffffff; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mentor</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #1c4587; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #1c4587; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #ffffff; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">A</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #1c4587; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #ffffff; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: norm