r" style="line-height: 1.3800000000000001; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 16pt;"><span style="font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial; color: #666666; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Topics</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 16pt;"><span style="font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial; color: #666666; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Update on the work done in previous week</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In </span><a href="teams/gsoc-17-media-manager/reports/547-1st-meeting-gsoc-2017-cloud-filesystems-for-media" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">previous meeting</span></a><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> it was suggested to implement Multiple Adapter Support in NMM, Kasun proposed a method and it was accepted by the whole team by 5/5 votes. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mentors and Admins accepted Kasun’s work schedule for GSoC program.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">After meeting David suggested to keep Kasun’s work in a separate branch called </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">gsoc17 </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">for keep project clean.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 16pt;"><span style="font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial; color: #666666; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Current Status</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">As promised Kasun has </span><a href="https://github.com/joomla-projects/media-manager-improvement/pull/244" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">finished</span></a><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> (merged PR) </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">backend API</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> to get work with multiple adapters.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Now the frontend client need to be fixed to use new features in backend to display data from multiple adapters. David fixed the client to get it work with Multiple Adapter support.</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/rro1TyrfsgkI4Aum5xNf79PXzXstV2k3Uyv1SzbaQMz0XsjW3wPizSzug-yYqSZcLYUT0uyJ761wi0HoP-WGhN9qvDcpCrIcaaxNYNNUk1ggBtUbO57htfWIFwQMtGxzwqixAgnG" alt="" width="624" height="399" style="border: none; transform: rotate(0.00rad); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad);" /></span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Two file adapters enabled with NMM</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 16pt;"><span style="font-size: 15pt; font-family: Arial; color: #666666; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Media File Serving (Phase 2)</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Since multiple adapter support is done in backend, a simple cloud plugin that would fetch data from something like a github repo would be nice to be implemented. It can be used to serve a file from the cloud as an example.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Kasun suggested to implement an interface entry </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">getPermalink($file)</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for serve media files which any 3rd party developer can implement the way its cloud system needs. With this interface entry even non cloud filesystems can be implemented. So this method will give more flexibility for 3rd party developers.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Kasun suggested that to add API endpoint to call this method in a need to get a permanant link to media file.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">David and Allon asked Kasun to prepare a detailed document about this and prepare a research report that lists similar plugins and their usage with architecture in other CMS systems.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Kasun promised to provide these documents. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1, 252, 2, 2498, '2017-06-22 08:53:36', 2498, '2017-06-22 08:54:41', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(566, 55, 0, 'Joomla Operations Department Meeting, June 21, 2017', 'joomla-operations-department-meeting-june-21-2017', '<h2 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Joomla Operations Department Meeting</h2>\r\n<p>Wednesday June 21 2017, 19:00:00 &nbsp;UTC</p>\r\n<p><strong>Participants</strong>: Jaz Parkyn (Extensions Directory Team), Olaf Offick (Forum&nbsp;Team), Peter Martin (Operations Department Coordinator), Brian Mitchell&nbsp;(Resource Directory Team), Sander Potjer (Volunteers Portal Team), Slawek Sikora&nbsp;(Template Directory Team).</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apologies</strong>: Helvecio da Silva (Community Magazine Team), Sebastien Lapoux (Showcase Directory Team).</p>\r\n<h2 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Minutes:</h2>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Operations Department Coordinator</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr"><a href="board-of-directors/reports/539-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-may-25-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Board of Directors Full Board Meeting - May 25st, 2017 (at JandBeyond)</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr"><a href="board-of-directors/reports/542-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-june-01-2017-jab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Board of Directors Full Board Meeting - June 1st, 2017 (at JandBeyond)</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr"><a href="board-of-directors/reports/559-osm-inc-full-board-meeting-june-15-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Board of Directors Full Board Meeting - June 16th, 2017</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Extensions Directory Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href="teams/extensions-directory-team/reports/509-jed-team-meeting-april-28-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a><a href="teams/extensions-directory-team/reports/538-jed-team-meeting-may-25-2017" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">JED Team Meeting - May 25, 2017</a><span style="background-color: transparent; color: #1155cc; font-family: Arial; font-size: 10pt; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></li>\r\n<li><span id="docs-internal-guid-01a0d869-cf28-bff9-3033-59ba1ded4e5c"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Vulnerability Extensions List (VEL) has been moved to subteam under JED. This structure change has been made because it makes more sense to have all 3rd party extension related under one team, and sites in the future under one domain. The structure change has been </span><a href="teams/vulnerable-extensions-list-team"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">implemented in the Volunteers Portal</span></a><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Forum Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href="teams/forum-team/reports/552-2017-05" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Forum statistics</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Resource Directory Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href="teams/resource-directory-team/reports/563-the-when-who-and-com-jrd-of-the-jrd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JRD Team Meeting - June 7 2017</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>The JRD has defined all roles in their team and will soon recruit for new members. Sander (JVP) mentioned that the Volunteers Portal has an option to set status of a role to “open” so that people can apply for a volunteer role.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Template Directory Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Template Directory Team (JTD) is being set up. They have contacted the Social Media Team to announce a call for volunteers for JTD. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">JTD added the available roles in JVP: </span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="teams/template-directory-team#roles" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://volunteers.joomla.org/teams/template-directory-team#roles</a></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Volunteers Portal Team</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The postal addresses of all Team members in the Volunteer Portal, a requirement of the OSM By-Laws, are only accessible by the OSM Secretary. Everyone (Site Admins, Developers) who has technical access to the database should have signed an NDA. There\'s confusion about how the NDA process actually works. Peter will ask information about it to the Board.</li>\r\n<li>JVP works together with Recognition Team on possible ways to improve the volunteer recognition</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Community Magazine Team</h3>\r\n<p>Helvecio not present. Carried over to next meeting.</p>\r\n<h3 style="font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333;">Showcase Directory Team</h3>\r\n<p>Sebastien not present. Carried over to next meeting.</p>', NULL, 1, 253, 1, 443, '2017-06-22 09:31:55', 0, '2017-06-22 09:47:00', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(567, 58, 0, 'OSM, Inc - Full Board Meeting - June 22, 2017', 'osm-inc-full-board-meeting-june-22-2017', '<h2 id="docs-internal-guid-978bdf35-da90-70d7-ba33-d0a6ef4934a0" dir="ltr">Open Source Matters, Inc.<br />Full Board of Directors and Officer Meeting</h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Date</span>: June 22, 2017</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Time</span>: 17:00 UTC</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Total time of meeting</span>: 1 hour 30 minutes</p>\r\n<h4 dir="ltr">Attendees:</h4>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Robert Jacobi (President), Aleksander Kuczek (Vice President), Luca Marzo (Secretary), Mike Demopoulos (Treasurer), Rowan Hoskyns-Abrahall (Director), Michael Babker (Director), Peter Martin (Director), Radek Suski (Director), Søren Beck Jensen (Director), Yves Hoppe (Director).</p>\r\n<h4 dir="ltr">Apologies:</h4>\r\n<p dir="ltr">-</p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr">Discussion outline</h2>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">President</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Robert proposed to discuss about the creation of the Local Communities Department. Robert to create an informal Local Communities Working Group to start gather information about all the active local communities and create a process to lead the formation of the new Department.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Production Department Report</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Joomla! 3.7.3 release planned for the next week.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Department is looking for feedback on the potential use of CSS Grid for Joomla! 4.0 - <a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/16810">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/16810</a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Automated testing architecture sprint successful, team will continue finalizing the architecture they worked on and aim to implement it into our pipeline in the next couple of months.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Legal &amp; Finance Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Board discussed about the consolidation of trademark registration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Capital Team is looking for new ways and platforms to increase the advertising revenues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">A micro-sponsorship platform has been developed and needs just some tweaks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Robert, Mike and Søren shared new sponsorship opportunities to be signed shortly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Marketing &amp; Communication Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Marketing team asked for a clear statement about the use of the exclamation mark following the word Joomla. The Board officially declares that it is not necessary to use the bang in Joomla name for blog posts/copy.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Events Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan shared the progress of JWC ticket sales.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">JWC Call for Sponsors and Speakers to go out next week.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan is working on an African event.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Operations Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">JRD to recruit new members shortly.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Template Directory Team (JTD) is being set up. They have contacted the Social Media Team to announce a call for volunteers for JTD.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Volunteers Portal has an option to set status of a role to “open” so that people can apply for a volunteer role.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Sander to appoint an Assistant Team Leader for the Volunteers Portal Team.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">VEL Team has been moved under JED Team.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Board discussed about NDA / CoC integration in the Volunteers Portal.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Programs Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Nothing relevant to report.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Vice President</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Agreement Working Group is in the reading phase of the contracts/agreements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Secretary</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Luca to publish a blog post on community.joomla.org about the upcoming Election Cycle.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Luca to publish a blog post about the “address requirement” of the Bylaws.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Board decided to use the Joomla! Volunteers Portal as Official Registry of Members.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Treasurer</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Mike is working on the blog post about the Budget.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Budget requests will go through Department Coordinators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Other business</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Yves reminded Board Members to fill out the Joomla! Leadership interview.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Motions taken during this meeting</h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><strong>#2017/044 - The Board officially declares that it is not necessary to use the bang in Joomla name for blog posts/copy. It does not affect the logo, brand name and registered trademarks.</strong></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Proposed by Radek Suski, seconded by Yves Hoppe.</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><em>The motion passed with unanimous consent.</em></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><strong>#2017/045 - Adopt the Joomla! Volunteers Portal as the official registry of members.</strong></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Proposed by Luca Marzo, seconded by Peter Martin.</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><em>The motion passed with unanimous consent.</em></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><strong>#2017/046 - The Secretary proposed to adjourn the Meeting.</strong></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Proposed by Luca Marzo, seconded by Yves Hoppe.</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><em>The motion passed with unanimous consent.</em></p>', NULL, 1, 254, 1, 669, '2017-06-24 14:44:34', 0, '2017-06-24 14:47:02', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(568, 0, 110, '2nd Meeting: GSoC 17 PR Testing Platform (17/05/2017)', '2nd-meeting-gsoc-17-pr-testing-platform-17-05-2017', '<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time:</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">17/05/2017, &nbsp;15:00 UTC</span></h2>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting Topics:</span></h2>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Work carried out since last meeting</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about the plans and deliverables</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Github repo project’s refactoring and tasks creation </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion on github and virtualisation project</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting Attended by:</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Niels Braczek, Tito Alvarez, Yves Hoppe, Ricardo Fusco, Tobias Zulauf</span></p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Summary</span></h2>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Work carried since last meeting</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Since the last meeting not much was achieved in practical terms since there was still a need for research on several topics, most of the research directed towards Docker Swarm in order to figure out how to start building the main scripts for swarm. </span></p>\r\n<ol start="2" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about the plans and deliverables</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Regarding the plans and deliverables for the project there was a need to discuss and decide on what those plans and deliverables are in the beginning. 3 big deliverables were identified, one for each phase, being the one for phase 1 having some of the main scripts for the docker environment having swarm, github and jenkins communicating. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">For phase 2 the tasks would be around the integration and adaptation of the virtualisation project into this project, and for the last phase finish the implementation of the PR tests request website and its integration with the work from the first 2 phases plus optimizations. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">All of this is open to further discussion of course due to it being still too early, this being a higher level specification of the work to be done still to be discussed again soon.</span></p>\r\n<ol start="3" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Github repo project’s refactoring and tasks creation</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The projects boards in the repository were renamed to more intuitive names including in the name the deliverables and a small description of the deliverables with the work periods for reference in the projects descriptions. Also first issues and tasks were created for the project related to phase 1. </span></p>\r\n<ol start="4" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion on github and virtualisation project</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The subject of Jenkins and the github api rate limits were approached by the team due to possible scenarios where the rate limits could be exceeded or not. Also discussed the virtualisation project and how it generates the final network configuration between the services and some specifics on how to test it so that a few tests could be done with it. </span></p>', NULL, 1, 255, 3, 2492, '2017-05-21 04:22:00', 2492, '2017-06-26 04:30:51', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(569, 0, 107, '4th Meeting GSoC 17 - Expand Extensions Manager', '4th-meeting-gsoc-17-expand-extensions-manager', '<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Date: 18/06/2017</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time: 20:00 PM UTC</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting was attended by: </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Anibal Sanchez, Nicola Galgano, Yves Hoppe, Nuno Lopes</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3090909090909089; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"><span style="font-size: 16.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Topics:</span></h2>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3333333333333333; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1- Introduction to Database fix for 3rd party extensions</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In J and Beyond 2017 (Krakow), there was a session “</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">JAB17 - Case Study : Giving a Joomla face to EkStep - a unique education platform</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">” where Ashwin Date commented that he was planning to submit a PR remarkably similar to &nbsp;one of the features of this our GSoC Project, that I’m planning to implement: </span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Database fix for 3rd party extensions</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, you can check it here </span><a href="https://youtu.be/BTzVec2hGNo?t=34m34s" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">https://youtu.be/BTzVec2hGNo?t=34m34s</span></a></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Before the weekly meeting of the project, we had a meeting (Me, Anibal Sanchez and Nicola Galgano) with Ashwin to discuss more what was made in this project so far. He presented the feature itself and also the UI.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">This meeting was short because I was very busy this week, studying for the final exams and delivering my last practical work. Overall, I couldn’t do much. I plan to continue with the roadmap the following weeks.</span></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3333333333333333; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2- Technical notes on the edit_updatesite PR</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The technical notes related to “Option to edit the update sites” has been officially reviewed by the core team, It will be ready to PR to joomla-cms/4.0-dev branch as soon as I write the PR.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3. Show Changelog feature technical note</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The implementation and technical notes about the “Show the changelog for an update” feature is also complete and waiting for the review of my mentors. After their review, it will be ready to be submitted to the core team.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">4. Next meeting</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In the next meeting, we will discuss the technical notes for the “Show the changelog for an update” feature and look again into the &nbsp;“Database fix for 3rd party extensions” feature</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1, 256, 1, 2495, '2017-06-26 15:56:13', 0, '2017-06-26 16:31:11', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(570, 0, 78, 'Certification Steering Meeting - June 27, 2017', 'certification-steering-meeting-june-27-2017', '<p id="docs-internal-guid-4a5f662f-e980-9a72-c965-d65c40184e3d" dir="ltr">The Joomla! Certification Steering Group meets every Tuesday at 1:00 PM GMT. This meeting was held on June 27, 2017 on Glip.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Team members</h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><em>In attendance</em>: Luca Marzo, Andrea Gentil, Chris Keen, Claudia Weber-Lenck.</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Discussion Outline</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Operations Team reported</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">3 new applications as JLP.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">1 new JUG application.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Applications will be processed within this week.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">No new exam events at this moment.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">JLP Directory on Joomla! Resources Directory will be removed. Certification Program will move the JLP Directory on the Certification Website.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">COT and CMT to work closely</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Marketing Team reported</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">JDUK exam promotion.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Answering questions, connect to the community, inform people about the exam, etc.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Exam Team reported</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">CET is working on the Question Management System, conducting real usage testing and suggesting improvements and needed features.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Meeting ends after 16 minutes.</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Communication to all Joomla! Learning Partners</h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr">To increase the effectiveness in the management of listings, we will remove Joomla! Learning Partners (JLP) listings on the Joomla! Resource Directory. Please be patient while we build the new JLP Directory on the Certification Website.</p>', NULL, 1, 257, 1, 669, '2017-06-27 12:21:56', 0, '2017-06-27 12:22:40', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(571, 0, 110, '3rd Meeting: GSoC 17 PR Testing Platform (24/05/2017)', '3rd-meeting-gsoc-17-pr-testing-platform-24-05-2017', '<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time:</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">24/05/2017, &nbsp;15:00 UTC</span></h2>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting Topics:</span></h2>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Attempts with Jenkins so far</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about the build systems used for tests</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about Github webhooks and Github API</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about swarm and first scripts </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting Attended by:</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Ashan Fernando, Niels Braczek, Tito Alvarez, Yves Hoppe, Ricardo Fusco, Tobias Zulauf</span></p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Summary</span></h2>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Attempts with Jenkins so far</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The first tests with Jenkins were not successful due to problems setting up the webhook &nbsp;and also due to problems in the Github Pull Requests Builder plugin and Jenkins version, had to retry installing Jenkins and the necessary plugins, next tests will be in that sense so that Jenkins can be correctly configured to build the PRs and commits. Also missing a tool to test webhooks locally, planning on using Ngrok, a tool that creates a tunnel for incoming requests so that the webhooks can be tested in a local context. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ol start="2" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about the build systems used for tests</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The build systems used in Joomla! CMS for the different tests were mentioned in order to figure out how to insert the jenkins job to build PRs/commits in between or at the end of the jobs from the other build systems related to tests.</span></p>\r\n<ol start="3" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about Github webhooks and Github API</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The webhooks and the github API were also mentioned in the meeting given that in order for the builds to be triggered there must be a webhook setup to either build each PR/commit automatically or with a command posted by an authorized user or allow both. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 7pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We also talked about the joomla github API which provides methods to communicate with the github API and which can be used in the project &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ol start="4" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; margin-left: 19pt;">\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussion about swarm and first scripts</span></h3>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span id="docs-internal-guid-d9c320c2-ea8f-2d87-ddcb-09203ebe1543"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Regarding swarm and the first scripts I did the first tests initializing a swarm with manager nodes and trying to build the scripts to initialize the swarm, some problems were encountered with those scripts mainly because with the exec() or shell_exec() methods some errors came up because the shell commands were ran separately and not in the same exec() command (not in the same shell “lifespan”). Robo was mentioned in order to try and solve those problems with the shell and implement those swarm initialization scripts as robo commands/tasks. The work with the first scripts to initialize the docker swarm was pushed into github to my fork to a specific branch (</span><a href="https://github.com/rjcf18/gsoc17_pr_testing_platform/tree/swarm-init"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">https://github.com/rjcf18/gsoc17_pr_testing_platform/tree/swarm-init</span></a><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">).</span></span></p>', NULL, 1, 258, 1, 2492, '2017-05-26 12:39:00', 0, '2017-06-27 17:21:05', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(572, 0, 109, '5th Meeting Joomla! GSoC 2017: JDocs Help Screens', '5th-meeting-joomla-gsoc-2017-jdocs-help-screens', '<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 3pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-style: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Date: 26th June 2017</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Time: 15:00 (UTC / GMT)</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting was attended by: João Reys Santos, Sandra Thevenet, Shivam Rajput, Tom Hutchison, Yves Hoppe, Dimitris Grammatikogiannis</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Team congratulated Shivam on his commitment and maintaining code quality while working on this project.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1 - Reviewing the Guide Tour Branch (</span><a href="https://github.com/joomla-projects/gsoc17_helpscreens_on_jdocs/tree/jsontest" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">https://github.com/joomla-projects/gsoc17_helpscreens_on_jdocs/tree/jsontest</span></a><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">).</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Discussions:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How to generate the translation files</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Dynamically</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Partially dynamically</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How to handle the translations of json files used to provide the content for the Tour</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Pull from a CDN, use Crowdin to translate json files</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thomas Hunziker set up a Crowdin project, </span><a href="https://crowdin.com/project/joomla-admin-guided-tour" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #729e52; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">https://crowdin.com/project/joomla-admin-guided-tour</span></a></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Will use </span><a href="https://rawgit.com/" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: #729e52; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">https://rawgit.com</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> as a temporary CDN server</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Open Questions:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Shivam asked. Who will put together the necessary json files needed for all the views by tour guide? </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">After meeting (Tom). Addressing the above question, can we generate a list of empty json files with all the views?</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2 - Making a proper agenda for the Bot.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Targets</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How to get images of admin view screenshots</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Where to store them?</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: square; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">GitHub</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: square; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Locally</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: square; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Push to JDocs</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How to name them</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How to import them into JDocs</span></p>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Upload script</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: circle; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Pywikipedia bot</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #282f34; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3 - Deciding a fixed day for Meeting every week. (If everyone agrees or I can prepare doodle every time :-) ).</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Decided Shivam will prepare a Doodle after each meeting for the next one. Too hard to include everyone in a set day and time each week. The mentors will try to have their times filled in no later than 2 days after the Doodle is sent so Shivam can start preparing for the next meeting. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1, 259, 1, 2497, '2017-06-27 18:07:22', 0, '2017-06-27 18:08:42', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
