 out.</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">SoMe assistant to be recruited + Sponsorship Assistant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">KEY DATES</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 27pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">07/08/2017 </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Launched JET </span></p>\r\n<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">19/08/2017</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;"> </span>JET Announced - Visa Applications open at 90 days out - Call for Speakers Closes</span></p>\r\n<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">31/08/2017 </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Full programme Announced - Early Bird Prices Start</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;"></span></p>\r\n<p><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">30/09/2017 </span>Regular Pricing begins</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;"></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">TICKETS / SELLING PACKAGES</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-e8bd64d5-c606-313c-f922-532d757692d1" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Sales have been steady. &nbsp;Expect pick up when speakers begin to be announced before blind bird sales end.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">TRANSLATIONS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-e8bd64d5-c607-1f76-a282-bb3a9b9e4f54" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Meeting with 3rd party to deliver translations through an app. Payment is per use, much cheaper than hiring headsets. &nbsp;App allows for sponsor logos and bios, which can be offered as an additional perk. &nbsp;App also allows a feed out to video allowing us to produce videos in both languages. &nbsp;Interpreter quotes are being obtained. &nbsp;We do however need to see a significant pickup in Italian attendees to justify the costs.</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 21pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">AV REQUIREMENTS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Brian</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-e8bd64d5-c607-dc90-a5e6-4d21fa9db8ce" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Early quotes are in from 2 vendors. Both suggest printed backdrops behind the stage</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">WEBSITE</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p id="docs-internal-guid-e8bd64d5-c608-7b20-c762-ae003dd3741c" dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.284; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Email lists from previous years have been collated and de-duplicated.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.284; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Hugh will be writing blog posts from now on and speaker announcements will start shortly, these will be collated into regular newsletters.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">SPONSORS</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mike D.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p id="docs-internal-guid-e8bd64d5-c609-09c6-3e24-cd869ffb571d" dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.284; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Although we have some sponsors contracted already, due to Treasury duties taking up more time than expected, we need to support Mike Demo. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.284; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Ronni will assist on the sponsorship team and we will recruit another negotiator alongside and support assistant to help with the workload.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">SPEAKERS &amp; Keynotes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">JENNIFER</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p id="docs-internal-guid-e8bd64d5-c60d-5db3-2ea0-a2c105ef54c5" dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.284; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">All the session speakers have been contacted and they’ve responded - mostly yes. Need to follow up on the workshops and short talks that haven’t replied. Next step to contact missing speakers. &nbsp;Also to write up a 