lor: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3800000000000001; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Upgrade path of the xtd media button</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3800000000000001; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Meeting schedule</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.9871999999999999; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3800000000000001; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Every two weeks a coding session where we organize our todos. Meetings where we need to discuss some specific tasks are organized ad hoc.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span></p>', NULL, 1, 360, 2, 1284, '2017-10-07 05:26:17', 1284, '2017-10-07 05:27:35', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(674, 58, 0, 'OSM, Inc. - Full Board Meeting - October 12, 2017', 'osm-inc-full-board-meeting-october-12-2017', '<h2 id="docs-internal-guid-501b469e-2491-4f53-2081-b4e2c81254a7" dir="ltr">Open Source Matters, Inc.<br />Full Board of Directors and Officers Meeting</h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Date</span>: October 12, 2017</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Time</span>: 17:00 UTC</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Total time of meeting</span>: 50 minutes</p>\r\n<h4 dir="ltr">Attendees:</h4>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Robert Jacobi (President), Aleksander Kuczek (Vice President), Luca Marzo (Secretary), Mike Demopoulos (Treasurer), Michael Babker (Director), Yves Hoppe (Director), Peter Martin (Director), Sandra Thevenet (Elected Director).</p>\r\n<h4 dir="ltr">Apologies:</h4>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan Hoskyns-Abrahall (Director), Radek Suski (Director), Søren Beck Jensen (Director).</p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr">Discussion outline</h2>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Treasurer</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Mike shared the Budget vs Actual YTD report.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">OSM will proceed with the Credit line.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Production Department Report</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">No major issues after last release, tentatively scheduling 3.8.2 for the beginning of November.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Development activity consistent on all active branches.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Production Department Leadership meeting this afternoon, more updates post-meeting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Legal &amp; Finance Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan is working with a sponsor to improve situation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Negotiations starting for new global sponsor.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Advertise page and micro sponsorship will be done within 2 weeks.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Trademark Team is on track, processing tickets and requests.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Marketing &amp; Communication Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Marketing Sprint in the beginning of november.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Social Media Team is working as usual.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Translation Team: reactivated. Trying to get the 3.8 landing page translated in more languages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">JWC Sprint will be dedicated to J4 marketing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Events Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan had to take corrective actions against some wrong information about JWC going on Italian community’s channels. An official statement has been published in English and Italian on the JWC website and social channels to clarify situation and truth about the event.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan will attend JoomlaDay Italy on Saturday October 14, 2017 and together with Luca will try to have more traction about JWC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Majority of flights for JWC have been done.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Operations Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Peter shared news from the Operations Department Leadership Meeting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Extensions Directory Team - Extra backlog due to the recent holiday season. JED recruited a new team member to help solving it.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Resource Directory Team - Backlog of submissions. The JRD recruited 2 new volunteers, one will help with solving the backlog.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Volunteers Portal Team - recruited 3 new members to help with development and moderation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Rowan has fixed what she could on the Joomla Resource Directory. The obvious listings in the queue have all been published, their ticket queue cleaned and categorised and they are now in better shape.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Part of the time of the Joomla! Template Directory team sprint (Frankfurt in October) will be used to work on the new prototype of Joomla! Resource Directory.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Sandra reported about the open issues on GitHub regarding Showcase Directory.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Programs Department</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Yves shared the results of the first round of Peakon surveys.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Volunteers Engagement Team needs to work on a new question / per department set.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Secretary</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Worked on OSM Invitation Letters for the Italian Embassy in several countries for JET recipients, Speakers and some sponsors employees.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Google notified/published the <a href="https://gsuite.google.com/terms/dpa_terms.html">DPA (Data Processing Amendment) related to GSuite services</a>. GDPR Working Group started reviewing it.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">GDPR Working Group will start involving team leaders assessing .org properties and tools to start working on Gap Analysis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Motions taken during this meeting</h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><strong>#2017/070 - JWC will take a rest in 2018. The efforts used will be directed at a global event sponsorship fund to ensure that Joomla events anytime, anywhere get the support and attention they deserve. Furthermore this will allow us to appear more often at events outside our ecosystem to reach a wider audience.<br /></strong>Proposed by Robert Jacobi, seconded by Yves Hoppe.<br /><em>The motion passed with majority consent and 1 abstention.</em></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><strong>#2017/071 - The Secretary proposes to adjourn the meeting</strong><br />Proposed by Luca Marzo, seconded by Peter Martin.<br /><em>The motion passed with unanimous consent.</em></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Motions taken offline before this meeting</h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr"><strong>#2017/069 - Approve the document called "Trademark Policy for new Top Level Domains (TLD)" as official policy regarding TLDs including one of the Joomla owned trademarks.</strong><br />Proposed by Luca Marzo, seconded by Rowan Hoskyns-Abrahall<br /><em>The motion passed with majority consent.</em></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1, 361, 1, 669, '2017-10-16 09:42:57', 0, '2017-10-16 09:45:00', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(675, 0, 2, 'Joomla Volunteers Portal team meeting 16 October 2017', 'joomla-volunteers-portal-team-meeting-16-october-2', '<p>Date: 16 October 2017 - Time: 16:30 UTC<br />Participants: Roland Dalmulder, Kumar Venkatesh, Sander Potjer<br />Apologies: Mihir Chhatre, Yves Hoppe, Zaki Abdullah</p>\r\n<h2>Minutes:</h2>\r\n<h3>Welcome!</h3>\r\n<p>Welcome to our new Volunteers Portal team members! A quick introduction about each of us, and what we would like to contribute to the Volunteers Portal and what we would like to get out of our contributions personally. The current team can be viewed here: https://volunteers.joomla.org/teams/volunteers-portal-team</p>\r\n<h3>Roles within the team</h3>\r\n<p>We discussed the roles within the team and the responsibilities. The team is also looking for an Assistant Team Leader, some team members will think about this in the next days.</p>\r\n<h3>Goals for the next months</h3>\r\n<p>The team discussed the goals for the next months, the main goals are:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Improve changing positions of members ( <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/154">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/154</a> )&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Improve the tools &amp; workflow for teams to communicate with each other, like sending email messages to all team members ( <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/155">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/155</a> )</li>\r\n<li>Improve the ability to match open positions (see the Help Wanted page) with volunteers willing to contribute based on skills &amp; interests. We need to add the skills to the volunteer profiles and roles for that and allow to set if a volunteer is available for the role. ( <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/119">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/119</a> )&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Implementing a system (e.g. badges) to recognise volunteers for their contributions across the entire Joomla!-project and make contributions visible on profiles, in collaboration with the Volunteer Engagement Team. This needs further discussion with the VET team at JWC as it needs to be worked out well in advance before starting to code. How will the system looks like and how can we make sure that all contributions (also offline, like organising a JUG-meeting) are taken into account and how will the “points earned” be defined and standardised.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>To keep track of the goals and smaller issues we will start working with labels and milestones on our Github repository: <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues</a>&nbsp;&amp; <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/milestones">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/milestones</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Teamwork</h3>\r\n<p>The team has a Glip channel for the day-day communication and will have a monthly online meeting via Google Hangout. This will take place every 2nd Monday of the month, 16:30 UTC. The next meeting is scheduled for December 11th. Communication around features and issues will take place on Github: <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Tasks</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Make the “Report as spammer” button visible for the public <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/156">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/156&nbsp;</a></li>\r\n<li>Button to reset spam reports <a href="https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/157">https://github.com/joomla/volunteers.joomla.org/issues/157&nbsp;</a></li>\r\n<li>Backend access, what agreements need to be signed? Check with OSM secretary</li>\r\n<li>Update dummy database for development&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Update issues with labels and milestone</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 362, 1, 430, '2017-10-16 18:02:47', 0, '2017-10-16 18:05:37', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(676, 0, 13, '17th October 2017 User Groups Team (JUG Team) Meeting minutes', '17th-of-october-2017-user-groups-team-jug-team-mee', '<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">In attendance:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Djamel Kherbi</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Jenn Gress</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Noemi Sanchez Del Rio</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Apologies:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Brian Row</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan Hoskyns-Abrahall</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">No Shows:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Eric Lamy</span></p>\r\n<p><b id="docs-internal-guid-44f15c9e-2b34-cdd2-cb17-f13cfe1a8a3c" style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We had our bi-monthly meeting second &nbsp;meeting for the month of October, held &nbsp;from 19 pm to 20 pm CET on Google hangout, the following items were discussed.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Update and pending listing, pending for approval on Joomla Greece Jenn is working on Greece &nbsp;and Joomla user Group Nancy Djamel is doing Nancy(France).</span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Review of the JUG Directory is on progress, we found that some JUG are not active, several listing where unpublished.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Our next meeting is on the 7th of November Jenn will Lead and Djamel is taking minutes. </span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.656; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; background-color: #ffffff;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, 1, 363, 2, 468, '2017-10-17 17:39:12', 468, '2017-10-17 17:41:22', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(677, 0, 120, 'GDPR Working Group - Update - October 24, 2017', 'gdpr-working-group-update-october-24-2017', '<p><em>This report is to announce the progress of GDPR Working Group no meeting has been held today.</em></p>\r\n<h3>Progress &amp; Achievements</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The group worked to a spreadsheet where almost all the systems / applications / websites / services used by the Joomla! Project are listed. The list includes also the owner and the data treated through the app/system.</li>\r\n<li>James and Marco shared some very useful files/tools to perform the GAP Analysis and the Assessment for all the systems used.</li>\r\n<li>The group started to perform the GAP Analysis on the joomla.org properties and applications.</li>\r\n<li>After the GAP Analysis, the Assessment will be performed in order to find and take the appropriate actions to be in compliance with the GDPR rules.</li>\r\n<li>During past days, Google sent us / published the Data Processing Addendum (DPA) according to GDPR related to Google GSuite services.</li>\r\n<li>The call for volunteers is still open, so new volunteers are welcome to join us in this process!</li>\r\n<li>Volunteers can submit their application at <a href="https://goo.gl/forms/eO3omnwKeiNtEOVI2">https://goo.gl/forms/eO3omnwKeiNtEOVI2</a></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 364, 2, 669, '2017-10-24 16:24:41', 669, '2017-10-24 16:37:17', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(678, 53, 0, 'Marketing & Communication Department Meeting - 25 October 2017', 'marketing-communication-department-meeting-25-octo', '<h3 id="docs-internal-guid-12f5817e-59de-8ba5-a7da-82c4860587c2" dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Attendees</span></h3>\r\n<ul style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Sandra Decoux - Department Coordinator / CTT Assistant Team Lead</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Ufuk Avcu - Marketing Team Lead</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Parth Lawate - Marketing Assistant Team Lead</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Alison Meeks - Social Media Team Lead</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Hans Van Der Meer - Social Media Assistant Team Lead</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Rowan Hoskyns Abrahall</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Department Coordinator</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">During the JWC Department Sprint, the team will define the global marketing for J4 (work on the landing page / teasing blog posts, articles for magazines, web hosting companies, influencers ; press releases / video, imagery, tutorials …)</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">A meeting is schedule for next week to plan the Joomla! In Action (common for marketing and social media).</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The general video project is on standby and needs to be re-activated, as we have no videos to present/promote the Project. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The marketing team is not providing content. We need to find ways to attract copywriters to promote Joomla better, inside but most of all outside the community.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Lukas has nearly finished the general intro/outros files for videos which will be publicly available for all. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The communication between all Departments and the Marketing &amp; Communication Department is nearly non-existent. It’s not possible for the teams of the department to do a correct job without real liaisons and without being aware of what’s going on in the other departments. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">A blogpost about the result of the German SEO contest will be published in the next days. </span></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Marketing</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The team would like to propose the creation of a new team under Operations ‘User Research’, which could be lead by Parth. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">No other update.</span></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Social Media</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The Team Lead is going to work on images to thank Sponsors/Partners (sponsor list req.) and will do the graphic to thank Translators for their work. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The Assistant Team Lead will prepare some more copywriting for posts and will work on finding solutions/ideas to reach more people outside the community.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Due to the amount of work needed, a call for a new member will be published in the next weeks.</span></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial; color: #434343; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Community Translation</span></h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Some languages have been finished and merged on the landing page which is now available in 32 languages. Some other languages are still in progress. The translators are also working on our other projects (some have been 100% translated).</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">The team needs a new leader. A call will be published in the next weeks.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">Meeting adjourned after 1 hour 15 minutes.</span></p>', NULL, 1, 365, 1, 530, '2017-10-26 18:07:08', 0, '2017-10-26 18:14:42', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(679, 0, 44, 'JED Team Meeting - October 27, 2017', 'jed-team-meeting-october-27-2017', '<p class="code-line" style="position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;" data-line="3"><img src="https://cdn.joomla.org/images/sharing/joomla-twitter-card.png" alt="JED Team Meeting - June 30, 2017 " style="max-height: 100%;" /></p>\r\n<p data-line="5">Today the Joomla! Extensions Directory (JED) team met at 2 pm GMT via Glip to discuss our progress of current tasks.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-line="7">\r\n<p data-line="7"><strong>In attendance</strong>: Jaz Parkyn, Anibal Sanchez, Daniel Dubois, Darek Śnieg, Hugh Douglas-Smith, Luca Marzo and Troy Hall.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-line="9">\r\n<p data-line="9"><strong>Absent</strong>: Aleksander Kuczek, Dénes Székely, Markus Bopp, Mark Lee, Martin Mueller, Miron Savan, Paul Franklin and Sotiris Katsaniotis.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id="jed-full-text-search-2017---search-improvements-candidates" class="code-line" style="font-weight: normal; position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif;" data-line="11">New Listing Specialists</h2>\r\n<p>To help in the processing of new extensions, two new listing specialists have been appointed and they processing their first extensions.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Darek Śnieg</li>\r\n<li>Troy Hall</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>As a general team agreement, we will strive to keep the list of pending extensions, reviews and tickets under 7 days of wait.</p>\r\n<p><em>We are actively monitoring&nbsp;the new&nbsp;extensions and tickets to keep the waiting under 7 days of delay.</em></p>\r\n<h2 class="code-line" style="font-weight: normal; position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif;" data-line="11">JED 4 - New System Specification</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-line="13">\r\n<p id="vel-team-organization" data-line="56">The new JED development process will be formalised first, specifications to be reviewed with the team for comments, additions and amendments, to plan the general development. At this time, we are evaluating possible technologies for the future implementation. The JED4 will be developed by volunteers in a series of sprints.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-line="13">\r\n<p id="vel-team-organization" data-line="56">The reviews and scoring functionality will remain a closed subject and its code will not present to the JED Devs - only available to JED Team Members.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-line="13">\r\n<p>Jaz has started to plan and define the next version of JED. She\'s been continually working on the specifications doc for the new com_jed, and will soon present it to the team for feedback in JWC Rome.&nbsp;Specification doc for JED 4 is nearly done.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>JED Full-Text Search 2017. Search improvements candidates. We are considering Algolia or Elastic Search. No decision yet on the supporting technology. We are exploring possible partnerships.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 id="jed-homepage-2017-updates-jorg-220-and-joomla-372" class="code-line" style="font-weight: normal; position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif;" data-line="40">JED Homepage 2017 updates</h2>\r\n<p data-line="46">Following the initial phase, we are working on the&nbsp;second phase:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-line="42">The new design must be applied to other areas of the site. (e.g. the search form located in the inner pages)</li>\r\n<li data-line="43">The new homepage has been successfully implemented. Though, more improvements are required.</li>\r\n<li data-line="49">Recently Added, Top Rated, Most Viewed modules are coming, on incremental small/new changes.</li>\r\n<li data-line="50">New scrolling widgets (similar to Google Play style).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class="code-line" style="font-weight: normal; position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif;" data-line="11">Google Summer of Code 2017: Enhancements to Extension Manager</h2>\r\n<p data-line="33">At this time, GSoC EEM has ended and&nbsp;all the PRs are submitted to J4 and J3.9. Matias, Niels and Anibal attended to the GSoC Mentor Summit (San Jose).</p>\r\n<p data-line="33">These are the final PRs:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>[4.0] Show changelog - GSoC Expand Extensions Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17536">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17536</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>[4.0] Download key manager - GSoC Expand Extensions Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17575">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17575</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>[4.0] Fix database for Extensions - GSoC Expand Extensions Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17537">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17537</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>[4.0] Edit UpdateSite - GSoC Expand Extensions Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17553">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17553</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>[4.0] Checksum extensions - GSoC Expand Extensions Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17555">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17555</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>README</strong></p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla-projects/gsoc17_expand_extension_manager/tree/GSoC">https://github.com/joomla-projects/gsoc17_expand_extension_manager/tree/GSoC</a></p>\r\n<p>The Extension Checksum has been backported to Joomla 3.8. Please, help us to test it:</p>\r\n<p><strong>[3.8] - light checksum for&nbsp;</strong>joomlaupdate</p>\r\n<p><a href="https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17632">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-cms/pull/17632</a></p>\r\n<p><span style="color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 22px;">The Review Checking Process</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The efforts to improve the process are ongoing. We expect further additions in the short term. We are already working on an updated review (IP Detective)&nbsp;checker that&nbsp;Hugh is setting up.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 class="code-line" style="font-weight: normal; position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif;" data-line="11">Developer Collaboration Process</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class="code-line" style="position: relative; color: #1e1e1e; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe WPC\', \'Segoe UI\', HelveticaNeue-Light, Ubuntu, \'Droid Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;" data-line="29"><em>Migration to Github</em>: Efforts are continuing in this direction.</li>\r\n<li><em>New Wiki</em>: we are documenting the support processes and canned answers in a new Wiki.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 366, 1, 628, '2017-10-27 17:04:19', 0, '2017-10-27 17:21:52', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(680, 0, 25, '2017-10 Joomla! Bug Squad Team Meeting', '2017-10-joomla-bug-squad-team-meeting', '<p dir="ltr">Friday, October 27th, 2017, 18:00 UTC on Glip</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div dir="ltr">\r\n<table><colgroup><col width="244" /><col width="49" /><col width="25" /><col width="235" /><col width="49" /><col width="24" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan="6">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Attendees</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan="2">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Niels Braczek (NB)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan="2">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Demis Palma (DP)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan="6">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Members</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Beat</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Kevin Griffiths</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Brian Teeman</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Leo Lammerink</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Chris Davenport</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Michael Babker (MB)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Constantin Romankiewicz</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Nicholas K. Dionysopoulos</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">David Steltz</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Nicola Galgano (NG)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Dimitris Grammatikogiannis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Niels van der Veer</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Franz Wohlkönig</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Peter Martin</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">George Wilson</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Robert Deutz</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Hervé Boinnard</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Roland Dalmulder</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Jean-Marie Simonet</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Troy Hall (TH)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan="6">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Candidates</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Allon Moritz</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Harald Leithner</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p dir="ltr">X</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan="6">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Liaisons</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan="2">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Sandra Thevenet (ST)<br />Documentation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td colspan="2">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Yves Hoppe (YH)<br />Automated Testing</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1 dir="ltr">INSERT INTO `#__volunteers_reports` (`id`, `department`, `team`, `title`, `alias`, `description`, `notes`, `state`, `ordering`, `version`, `created_by`, `created`, `modified_by`, `modified`, `checked_out`, `checked_out_time`) VALUES
	(686, 0, 7, 'Marketing Report - October 2017', 'marketing-report-october-2017', '<p dir="ltr">This meeting covers the preparation of “Joomla in Action” for the Joomla World Conference in Italy / Rom.</p>\r\n<p>Attendees:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ufuk Avcu</li>\r\n<li>Shirat Goldstein</li>\r\n<li>Parth Lawate</li>\r\n<li>Sandra Thevenet</li>\r\n<li>Yves Hoppe</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Divide up into two parts</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Action Part</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Try to do so many of the tasks we have.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">First JIA Part from 15:00 to 16:30 +30 Minutes or more if needed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Discussion Part</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Joomla Future - Wishes and Ideas!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Second JIA Part from 17:00 to 18:30</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Invite also some of the other Joomla Stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Defined Target Groups</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Designers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Talkers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Copywriters</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Translators</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Do’ers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Tasks</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Create imagery for the thank you campaign</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-marketing/issues/63</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">For Designers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Collect Youtube Videos with Joomla Tutorials</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">For Do’ers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-marketing/issues/70</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">The Joomla Future - Wishes and Ideas!</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">For Talkers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Extend the Use Case Campaign</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">For Copywriters</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-marketing/issues/64</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Collect all important Dates</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">For Do’ers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-marketing/issues/65</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Projects</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-marketing/projects/3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Ideas</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Selfie Testimonial Videos Competition</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">https://github.com/joomla/joomla-marketing/issues/120</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Avoid</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">To much discussions at the beginning</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br /><br /></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Short Term Tasks</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Ask the other Marketing &amp; Communication Departments, if they want to participate</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Ufuk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Prepare a presentation for “Joomla in Action”</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Parth and Ufuk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Next meeting</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">6.11.2017 at 8.30 UTC +2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 373, 2, 519, '2017-11-02 08:40:21', 519, '2017-11-06 09:39:57', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(687, 0, 78, 'Certification Team Meeting - November 07, 2017', 'certification-team-meeting-november-07-2017', '<p id="docs-internal-guid-481f3b2e-96b7-7e8d-a8ea-711fe6f8f788" dir="ltr"><em>The Joomla! Certification Team meets monthly on Tuesday at 2:00 PM GMT. This meeting was held on November 07th, 2017 on Glip.</em></p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Team members</h3>\r\n<p dir="ltr">In attendance: Sam Suresh, Luca Marzo, Andrea Gentil, Oscar Ortiz, Chris Keen, Adamzy Lee.</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr">Discussion Outline</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Luca to send all members logistic/organizational info about the JWC Sprint.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Team is going to review the JCP Goals/Agenda for the JWC Sprint.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Nicky Veitch will attend the sprint at JWC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Team discussed about the Italian Exam at JWC. Translation is done and reviewed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Sam to import the Italian Exam in the platform on Thursday. Tests will be done before the JWC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Andrea and Luca to prepare an agreement for an initiative regarding ambassadors at JWC.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr">\r\n<p dir="ltr">Luca shared the plan to restructure the JCP Program with Sam, seeking for comments before to submit it with the whole JCP.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir="ltr">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr">Meeting ends after 35 minutes.</p>', NULL, 1, 374, 2, 669, '2017-11-07 13:36:52', 669, '2017-11-07 13:43:32', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(688, 0, 8, 'Ready for Joomla World Conference', 'ready-for-joomla-world-conference', '<p><span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent;">Brian Mitchell will be attending the Joomla World Conference. We discussed the overall status, direction and improvements under development for the JRD. We are pleased to announce that all JRD submissions have been reviewed and there is nothing in the queue. </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Agenda:</span></p>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sort function and fields</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Submission reviews and approvals</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Posting minutes to JRD news (Karen)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Previous meeting minutes review and approval</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><b id="docs-internal-guid-534f710a-9734-cda4-8cb0-072553777030" style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Submission review:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Stefan has caught up on the submission reviews. All listings have been reviewed and the queue is gone! Stefan rocks :) Prior to that Rowan had finished the submissions that were way behind.</span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Newsletter:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">What should be included? -- An apology for past lack of communication, the delays, and what we’re doing to address it. Brian will finish newsletter this week; need ACYmailing template from Rowan. </span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sort Filters:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Random by default</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Would be useful to do a survey users to learn what people want</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Category and geo are a given</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We reviewed JRD New Fields per Rowan; took what Deb had done and then added to it. </span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan: </span></p>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Current system isn’t configured to suit JRD, new system under development</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">First step is to get a working directory with baseline search function (e.g. by geo, category), then survey the users. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">New fields could help capture community involvement, e.g. links to sites on showcase, listing on volunteer portal, forum, magazine listing, etc. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Brian: </span></p>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Need fields that capture actual community involvement. Consideration re directory listing - What is the relationship with individuals and the company’s they work for? Individual contribution and/or company contribution</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Want to add periodic review needed so that the data is current; currently no process to remove a listing. </span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">On the call: </span><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; white-space: pre; display: inline !important;"> </span></p>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Stefan</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Karen</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Brian</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Deb</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Next meeting:</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">November 21, 2017</span></p>', NULL, 1, 375, 5, 2106, '2017-11-07 15:54:14', 2106, '2017-11-07 16:10:12', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(689, 0, 13, '7 November 2017 JUG Team Meeting', '7-november-2017-jug-team-meeting', '<p><strong>In attendance:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Djamel Kherbi<br />Noemi Sanchez del Rio<br />Jenn Gress</p>\r\n<p><strong>Apologies:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Brian Ronnow<br />Rowan Hoskyns-Abrahall</p>\r\n<p><strong>No Show:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Eric Lamy</p>\r\n<p>Easy meeting this week as we didn\'t have a lot to discuss. Went over reviews. Noemi to start working on hers very soon. Djamel to wrap up Brasil shortly.</p>\r\n<p>We talked about dog bites and owners who have dogs that bite (heal up fast Noemi!), costume make-up, taxi\'s from airports, food, and how excited we all are to meet again (or for the first time) at JWC2017.</p>\r\n<p>Next meeting 5 December. Jenn to lead and someone else will take minutes.</p>', NULL, 1, 376, 1, 535, '2017-11-07 18:48:53', 0, '2017-11-07 18:53:05', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(690, 0, 22, 'JWC Meeting Minutes - 7th November 2017', 'jwc-meeting-minutes-7th-november-2017', '<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">JWC Meeting Agenda </span><span style="font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">7th November at 17:00 UTC</span></h2>\r\n<p><b id="docs-internal-guid-27f89cca-97e2-eac1-c422-75836f3dd6a1" style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Scheduled length of time</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">: 60 Minutes</span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Participants:</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Ronni K. Gothard Christiansen, Brian Peat, Sandra Decoux, MikeDemo (late), Rowan Hoskyns Abrahall, Hugh Douglas-Smith, Davide Messla</span></p>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;"><br /><br /></b></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Apologies: </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Alison Meeks, Jennifer Gress, Luca Marzo, Roberto Longo</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Agenda Items &amp; minutes:</span></h3>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;</b></p>\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 0.75pt;">\r\n<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="458" /><col width="157" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Marketing Team Updates</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Hugh</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Tickets to close Friday the 10th!!! </span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">email to be setup this evening as final notification!</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;"><br /><br /></b></p>\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 0.75pt;">\r\n<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="458" /><col width="157" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Social Media Team Updates</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sandra</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3 to 4 posts per day on FB and Twitter (+ some retweets on Twitter). </span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Still 25 speakers to share + 8 sponsors</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Super good job by SoMe team.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;"><br /><br /></b></p>\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 0.75pt;">\r\n<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="458" /><col width="157" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">KEY DATES</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rowan</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 22pt;">\r\n<td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">15th Nov. - “On the ground” team meeting and setup starts</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">10th Nov. - &nbsp;Ticket sales stops</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">9th Nov. - Name badges print deadline</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">8th Nov. - Program print deadline</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><b style="font-weight: normal;"><br /><br /></b></p>\r\n<div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 0.75pt;">\r\n<table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="458" /><col width="157" /></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">SALES - as of 07 Nov-17</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; background-color: #efefef; padding: 5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt; border: solid #000000 0.5p