Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Members</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Allon Moritz</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;"></td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">X</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Jean-Marie Simonet</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;"></td>\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.32pt; border: solid #000000 1pt;"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style="height: 0pt;">\r\n<td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 4.32pt 4.32pt 4.3