'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Unban Form - moving to a more general helpdesk system</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">SPAM, do we need new solution</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">New Forum Moderators</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">OSM request: How does the Forum team empowers website professionals?</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">OSM request: Can the Forum Team define Key Performance Indicators?</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Forum rules review</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Other Items</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h1 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 24pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Oswald; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">NOTES &amp; ACTION ITEM</span></h1>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Unban Form make contact to get a demo setup</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Anti Spam is working at the moment</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">New Forum Moderators (we will create new forum topics about any future forum moderators) and also add a forum topic for Moderators which are not responding to any of our messages.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Forum Team gives free support (but it might not be timely support), and the forum allows people to help other users.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Key Performance Indicators:<br /></span>Number of warnings</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Number of bans (manually)</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Number of moderator actions</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">(look at the Forum Stats to include those details)</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Forum Rules, do we need a GDPR rule? (Contact GDPR Team to find out)</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Add “No Support request via email”</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Add Plagiarism Rule that Plagiarism is not allowed in the forum</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">“No commercial advertising is permitted.” added for Signature Rule</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Quarantine Forum cleanup (Kristian volunteered to look at those)</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br class="kix-line-break" /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Reported Messaged cleanup</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h1 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 24pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 13.999999999999998pt; font-family: Oswald; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">NEXT MEETING’S DATE AND AGENDA</span></h1>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.7999999999999998; margin-top: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\'; color: #424242; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">March 18th 2018 - 18.00 UTC</span></p>', NULL, 1, 432, 1, 503, '2018-02-13 12:18:59', 0, '2018-02-13 12:22:34', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(746, 0, 127, 'Team Meeting - February 14, 2018', 'team-meeting-february-14-2018', '<p>Participants: Wilco Alsemgeest, Chris Keen, Jeroen Moolenschot, Claudia Weber-Lenck</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>We received a lot of responses on the JCP Newsletters looking for translators.<br />Everybody who responded will receive a mail response.</li>\r\n<li>Created a question review component to be able to replace QMS when we start using Shika.</li>\r\n<li>All open positions are added to the volunteers portal [<a href="help-wanted">https://volunteers.joomla.org/help-wanted</a>]</li>\r\n<li>Translations are ongoing (Dutch 82%, Italian 54%, French 13%)</li>\r\n<li>All remarks from the translators on the questions will be collected and discussed.<br />Where needed the questions will be updated.</li>\r\n<li>JCP CEPT Sprint report will be finalized today.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, 1, 433, 2, 2198, '2018-02-14 21:10:06', 2198, '2018-02-14 21:14:44', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
	(747, 0, 78, 'Certification Steering Meeting - February 14, 2018', 'certification-steering-meeting-february-14-2018', '<p><em>The Joomla! Certification Steering Group meets every Wednesday at 15.00 PM CET. </em><br /><em>This meeting was held on February 14, </em>2018<em>, @ 15:00 PM CET, on Glip.</em></p>\r\n<h3>Team members</h3>\r\n<p>In attendance: Chris Keen, Luca Marzo, Wilco Alsemgeest, Jeroen Moolenschot, Andrea Gentil.</p>\r\n<h3>Discussion Outline</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Steering Group is working to document the JCP plan for 2018.</li>\r\n<li>A newsletter was sent to reach certified users inviting them to help with translations.</li>\r\n<li>A new version of the JUG contract is finally approved and has been uploaded to EchoSign.</li>\r\n<li>Jan van Kuijk joined COMT to help us to improve the process regarding JUGs.</li>\r\n<li>Nicky is going to move as "Ambassador" for the East region, including Asia, Far East, Malaysia, Australia, Philippines.</li>\r\n<li>Luca and Andrea reviewed the structure proposal for the JCP website.</li>\r\n<li>Translations for German, Dutch, Italian are ongoing.</li>\r\n<li>CEPT is working to consolidate the two properties of the Certification Program (certification.joomla.org and exam.joomla.org) under one website.</li>\r\n<li>CEPT updated the needs in term of volunteers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><br />The meeting ended after 65 minutes.</p>', NULL, 1, 434, 1, 1459, '2018-02-16 08:46:22', 0, '2018-02-16 08:52:51', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
</span></h1>\r\n<h1 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 20pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Agenda / Minutes</span></h1>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1 Member List</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Alessandro Rossi (AlexRed) asked Jean-Marie if he could join the Bug Squad team.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">According to Jean-Marie, it would be a good idea, as he is helping a lot testing and creating issues.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The application was rejected by 4-2 voices.</span></p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">2 Volunteers Portal</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Please add your address on the Volunteers Portal, if you haven’t done that yet. It is a legal requirement for voting members.</span></p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3 PR Priority List</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The priority list consists of the issues marked with milestone 3.8.</span></p>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">4 News from Production Department Meeting </span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The PD meeting was held the day before this meeting</span></p>\r\n<ol style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;">\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Separation of tests from code - The Automated Testing Team has put some effort into separating tests from the code they test. One of the goals was to enable developers to test PRs with different sets of tests.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir="ltr" style="list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;">\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The PR Testing Platform developed by Ricardo Fusco in a GSoC project this year will be integrated into the tracker, so PRs get a button like ‘Test Me’ on them. The PR Testing Platform is a tool that creates two Joomla instances on demand in a sandbox for any PR, one with the patch applied and one without.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">5 Miscellaneous</span></h2>\r\n<h2 dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;"><span style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">6 Next Meeting</span></h2>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Regular team meeting each month on the 3</span><span style="font-size: 6.6pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: super; white-space: pre-wrap;">rd</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Friday at 18:00 UTC on Glip.</span></p>\r\n<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Next time Friday, Dec, 15</span><span style="font-size: 6.6pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: super; white-space: pre-wrap;">th</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> on Glip.</span></p>\r\n<p></p>', NULL, 1, 435, 1, 625, '2018-02-16 14:22:37', 0, '2018-02-16 14:23:31', 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00'),
